    "en": {
      "trackName": "8 Ball Pool for Watch",
      "description": "Experience the classic 8 Ball Pool game directly on your wrist!\n8 Ball Pool for Watch is the ultimate billiards simulation designed specifically for your smartwatch. Whether you are commuting, waiting in line, or just want a quick game, the pool table is now always with you. No phone required!\nKey Features:\n\t•\tWrist Gameplay: Optimized specifically for the small screen of your watch.\n\t•\tCrown Control: Rotate the watch crown for precise aiming and accuracy.\n\t•\tInstant Play: Fast loading times for quick matches on the go.\n\t•\tRealistic Physics: Authentic ball collisions and smooth movements.\n\t•\tOffline Mode: Play anywhere, anytime, without an internet connection.\nDownload now and become a pool master on your watch!",
      "releaseNotes": "",
